  "tag": "k4",
  "purpose": "H.STA.BLK.1 HC Sinkhorn tail child MAIN k4 (hard child x2 in the HC root, TAILC=1): TPIPE 1 + SKP 2 (SQO) + SDIV 17, gate-level CLONED netlist (per-module ABC map, bound_fanout_clone --limit 24, retained re-synth, compact). Square 388.8 x 388.8; mixes W / bases+scales+launch N / result E, clk+rst_n S. Parallel fallback = hbm_hc_tail_child_k4b (same netlist, equal-delay clock spine). | SAFE checklist (HBM-ELEM13/HC-TAIL 10-21, rebuilt after the k3 --cts gate: TT placement -300 / CTS SS -363 at the Sinkhorn sticky fault flop, cone = steady quotient Q3 segment + range compare + 16-way s_bad OR from 1,938 cut flops; FF hold stall -39.7 (5 R2R) after 24.6k hold buffers): 1 pins PASS (RTL pin flop + 2nd stage on every data pin, output pin flops; rst_n reset_landing 2 then ot_rst_relay 3 regions + kept leaf) | 2 reach PASS by plan: square 388.8 um < 405, every pin->core hop registered; post-GRT 405 by gate | 3 fanout PASS: clone limit 24, native32 census on mapped + retained netlist | 4 depth FIXED: no multicycle; Sinkhorn steady step now 16 single-period segments with the quotient output cut QO (y / range registered, SQO 1 via SKP 2, SDIV 17): the fault OR and the st write start at registers; tail TPIPE 1 unchanged (k3b same tail: TT -22 pre-repair) | 5 storage PASS: no runtime-indexed flop array > 2 kb (the 6,144-b mix store is in the HC root, SRAM under SAFE 1) | 6 floorplan PASS: no macros, util ~0.48, square, one full std-cell band | 7 clock: ONE root clk, no derived clock; boundary pin-flop spread <= 80 by --cts gate (k3: 28.7/28.6) | 8 reset PASS: only control/valid flops reset (data OT_FP_DATA_NORST), regional relay; schedule static, no backpressure; child L 989 (+493 edges over L 496): root TAILC emit offset TE 2 -> 495 (root xr4).",
  "structural_change": "Sinkhorn steady-step quotient output cut QO (ot_hdc_sinkhorn_cp SQO 1, SKP 2, SDIV 17; removes the k3 Q3->range->s_bad OR->fault cone) on the k3 floorplan and default CTS",
